  m_text: 'Q: How do i login?

    A: You can login after you register on the sign
    up page.


    Q: How do i send feedback to the developers?

    A: You can send
    messages after creating an user then going to the FAQ and then the Help page


    Q:
    How do i see my stats?

    A: As long as you are logged in you can view your
    stats on the stats page


    Q: When will you add Dragon Juichitenkai?

